- Bravura music font — SIL Open Font License 1.1
  src/fretsure/web_static/font/Bravura-OFL.txt
- Instrument Serif, Manrope — SIL Open Font License 1.1
  src/fretsure/web_static/licenses/OFL-1.1.txt
