  src/fretsure/audio_data/LICENSE

Full third-party attribution is recorded in
src/fretsure/web_static/licenses/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt.

Python dependencies are resolved from PyPI and pinned by uv.lock rather than
copied into this repository. The optional `exports` extra pulls in PyGuitarPro
(LGPL-3.0-only) and ReportLab (BSD); both stay separate installable packages.

The benchmark corpus ships three licensed public-domain or openly licensed
scores under src/fretsure/bench/data/sources/. Their sources, licences and
digests are recorded in src/fretsure/bench/data/source-census.json.
